y.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters are equally viable! There is no meta or tier list - the best one is the one you fancy most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mayhem! Will you work together, or get in each others' way?</p></li></ul>","developers":["ButterySoft, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310090/12e66e2191dfe7779b70ea943be5829fe61cb35c/header.jpg?t=1770240765","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3310090/1022759347/d83669573ed2c060c344928a24aa8de358250cc7/1750870684/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749684840","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3310090/1022759347/d83669573ed2c060c344928a24aa8de358250cc7/1750870684/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749684840","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3310090/1022759347/d83669573ed2c060c344928a24aa8de358250cc7/1750870684/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749684840","id":257155705,"name":"Demo Announce","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155705/bd5cac80bfbb3de5a7264047b1f20c5d184821f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749684840"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3310090/822567/4c1f286efc2d32f476d25fcd7907d203b925472f/1750870683/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739576354","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3310090/822567/4c1f286efc2d32f476d25fcd7907d203b925472f/1750870683/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739576354","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3310090/822567/4c1f286efc2d32f476d25fcd7907d203b925472f/1750870683/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1739576354","id":257094488,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094488/07f5